      "content": "okay fine, i'll try the water for now. but the blisters are getting kind of big and the skin looks really shiny and wet. it's making me super anxious, like i'm gonna lose a lot of fluid or something. if i really can't make it to a clinic tonight, is there any kind of antibiotic ointment or even just some honey i can put on it to seal it up so it doesn't get worse in the morning?",
